+## Shared7 development validation and replay
+
+Workspace includes a separate collapsed validation panel for all twenty frozen
+shared7 examples. Its protocol is `gamma.literal-shared7-interactive.v1`, using
+IDs 125/126/127 for Undo/Reset/Finish; IDs 79–124 are rejected. This is separate
+from the main `bits-literal-shared7-v1` typing profile and its 79–81 controls.
+Every emitted source character still comes from the same 79 literal strings.
+The panel supports exact read-only replay and native Gamma development checks
+(3,834 cases over 20 programs), with no page evaluation or autonomous-synthesis
+claim. Source-only benchmark costs exclude interactive controls. Gamma's
+`projects/algorithm_solver/literals/demo/README.md` documents limits and evidence.
